    {
      "path": "cordis.patch.yml",
      "text": "# Insert dsh-auto-blame: cynical follow-up suggestion bubbles above the composer.\n# When a turn closes, the host asks an LLM for three pushy follow-up prompts and\n# projects them to the client, which renders them as click-to-send bubbles in\n# the composer dock. A click feeds the text to inputActions.setDraft + submit.\n#\n# The `enabled` master switch is the composition base (first-boot seed); user\n# edits live in $DSH_HOME/settings.yaml under the `auto-blame` namespace. The\n# host gates the turn-stopping LLM call on this flag — false means no token\n# cost, no projection event, no bubbles.\n- insert:\n    - id: dsh-auto-blame\n      name: '@huanlin/dsh-plugin-auto-blame'\n      config:\n        enabled: true\n"
    }
  ],
