  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://dshfind.com/zh/plugins/huanlinoto/dsh-plugin-auto-blame\"><img src=\"https://dshfind.com/api/card/huanlinoto/dsh-plugin-auto-blame?lang=zh\" alt=\"dsh-plugin-auto-blame card\"></a>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-auto-blame",
      "text": "[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@huanlin/dsh-plugin-auto-blame)\n\n当模型完成当前轮次对话后，将最后 3 条消息发送给 LLM，生成 3 条批判性跟进请求，显示在输入框上方作为可选项，点击直接发送。生成期间\"领导视野\"标签带 DeepSeek 蓝色流光扫过（同 Deep diving... 特效），建议到达后气泡依次淡入。"
    },
    {
      "section": "工作原理",
      "text": "```\n[host] agent/turn-stopping 触发\n  → fire-and-forget 调 ctx.llm.stream() 生成 3 条毒舌跟进\n  → session.append('auto-blame/suggestions', { turn, suggestions })\n  → projection unit 折叠该事件 → session/projection 推送帧\n\n- **fire-and-forget**：LLM 调用不阻塞 turn 关闭，建议晚几百 ms 出现\n- **非 surface 事件**：`auto-blame/suggestions` 不进入 model-visible 历史，不干扰 agent loop\n- **失败静默**：LLM 失败 / 解析失败 → 不 append 事件，不显示气泡\n- **点击发送**：走 InputBar 同一路径（`inputActions.setDraft + submit`）\n- **下一轮清空**：新 turn 开始时 projection 归零，旧气泡立即消失"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm run typecheck    # tsc --noEmit\npnpm test             # vitest run（28 个单测）\npnpm run build        # tsc + tsdown → lib/index.js, lib/invariant.js, lib/client.js\npnpm run bundle:client # 只构建 client bundle"
    },
    {
      "section": "依赖链接（sibling dsh checkout）",
      "text": "本插件依赖 `@deepseek-ai/dsh-*` workspace 包。开发时需要手动 Junction 链接到 sibling dsh checkout：\n\n```powershell\n$dest = 'node_modules\\@deepseek-ai'\nNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $dest -Force"
    },
    {
      "section": "参考 dsh-spur 的 node_modules 结构创建 Junction",
      "text": "```\n\n或从 `dsh-spur` 复制 `node_modules`（含 typescript / tsdown / vitest / @types/* / cordis / @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-*），再补建 `dsh-agent` / `dsh-llm` / `dsh-session` / `dsh-session-projection` 的 Junction。"
    },
    {
      "section": "运行",
      "text": "```sh"
    },
    {
      "section": "从 npm 安装（推荐）",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add @huanlin/dsh-plugin-auto-blame"
    },
    {
      "section": "本地开发（热更新）",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add \"link:D:/Projects/deepseek-harness/dsh-auto-blame\"\n```\n\n安装后重启 `dsh web` + 浏览器硬刷新（`Ctrl+Shift+R`）。"
    },
    {
